---
 debian/changelog                              |  9 ++++
 .../patches/2001_make-module-resident.patch   | 41 +++++++++++++++++++
 debian/patches/series                         |  1 +
 3 files changed, 51 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 debian/patches/2001_make-module-resident.patch

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index b583bdf..41d8c59 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+appmenu-gtk-module (25.04-1build1+unity1) resolute; urgency=medium
+
+  * debian/patches/2001_make-module-resident.patch: make the GTK module
+    resident (upstream a783b01c). GTK3 unloads a module loaded through the
